 "text": "Recorder | Blackford County, IN\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nCommunity\nDepartments\nGovernment\nPrograms & Activities\nServices\nHome\nGovernment\nRecorder\nRecorder\nThe Recorder's Office performs several duties of recording and preservation of documents such as deeds, mortgages, miscellaneous and DD 214 records for the citizens of Blackford County.\nServices\nChoose from one of the following links for specific information about services provided by the department:\nFee Schedule (See in the following section)\nAssumed Business Names\nCounty Fee Schedule\nIndiana County Recorder's Fee Schedule\n(Effective July 1, 2017)\nMortgages (including Mortgages, Subordinate Mortgages, Corrective Mortgages, Re-recorded Mortgages, Indentures and Supplemental Indentures): $55\nDeeds and all other instruments, including re-recorded instruments (fee includes 1 oversize page): $25\nAdditional pages exceeding 8 ½ inches by 14 inches within any document shall be charged: $5 each\nMechanic's Lien including one mail out: $25\nEach additional mail out: $2\nFor counties accepting multiple transaction documents: $25 (a/k/a blanket documents)\nPlus for each additional cross reference after the first: $7 each\nUniform Commercial Code\nUCC Flat Fee: $25\nUCC Continuation, amendment or Assignment, 2 pages or less: $6\n3 pages or more: $10\nUCC-11 Information Request, per debtor name: $7 Each additional name: $5\nCopies 11 inches by 17 inches or smaller, per page: $1\nCopies larger than 11 inches by 17 inches, per page: $5\nCertification of Document: $5\nContact Us\nRecorder\nContact the Recorder\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n110 W Washington\nHartford City , IN 47348\n110 W Washington Hartford City IN 47348\nDirections\nPhone: 765-348-2207\nFax: 765-348-7222\nHours\nMonday through Friday\n8 am to 4 pm\nDirectory\nAgendas & Minutes\nAuditor\nClerk\nContact Us\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Council\nJustice\nCircuit Court\nCommunity Corrections\nProbation\nProsecutor\nSheriff's Office\nMerit Deputies\nCorrection Officers\nDispatch\nAdministrative Staff\nCourthouse Security\nSuperior Court\nRecorder\nTreasurer\nMeetings, Agendas & Minutes\nOnline Bill Pay\nForms\nFacilities\nRecords\nNotifications\n-->\nContact Us\nBlackford County\n110 West Washington Street\nHartford City, IN, 47348\nQuick Links\nBlackford Townships\nCommunity Directory\nFAQs\nVisit Blackford\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nAccessibility\nSite Map\nCopyright Notices\nContact Us\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options",
